 "ai": "normal",
 "intro": [
  "The Lockstone has broken and the whole Host is coming out. Most of it marches on the Concord. Some of it stays below, and it is burning the Barrow Below tomb by tomb. Morvath the Kindler, who remembers the Sealing, feeds the dead to his fires because he likes the smell.",
  "Tier 7 is open: charnel hulks. While Morvath holds two of his halls, his kindlers come for the Tomb of Kings and the Weeping Tomb. A tomb that falls to him burns, and its dead are gone for good.",
  "Take the Kiln Halls and the Cinder Gallery, then put out Morvath's Furnace."
 ],
