   },
   "text": [
    "Morvath's fires go out one by one. The tombs of the kings stand, black with soot, and their dead stand in them.",
    "But the dead who were burned elsewhere do not come back: there is nothing left of them to raise. For the first time in three hundred years Ysmay Vane is afraid of something."
   ]
  },
